    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829957de7c961c2d9f2d75a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从以前开始，我便一直在思考，\n该如何给予写信给我的各位\n一份符合圣女身份的回礼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee11b7869b139b0e1b3a055b2120ddcbbc24225746cffe6f46b2320d8b743e2f",
