      "uid": "zhcn:ece0dc5fc84156cd8c546614",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，我想到的便是卢恩文字。\n因为即便只是一个文字，\n其中也蕴含着各种各样的意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7346cc624e875fa9acc42cb57b199b65da58ec6e78bf3b19911b3f9258a1d82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
